    "en": {
      "trackName": "WristTube for YouTube",
      "description": "Discover the world of YouTube videos right on your wrist with WristTube! Now, you can watch any video directly on your watch, including live streams. Compatible with all Apple Watch models, both GPS and LTE versions, you can still enjoy videos on WristTube with the LTE version without needing to connect to your iPhone, ensuring an uninterrupted experience. This app offers a convenient and intuitive video-watching experience, allowing you to stay updated and manage your content easily from your watch.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Watch YouTube Videos: Access and watch YouTube videos in quality ranging from Standard to UHD right on your wrist.\n- Video player controller: full features including fast forward/rewind, playback speed adjustment, loop video, sleep timer, and more.\n- Support for watching live videos\n- Sync with Your YouTube Account: Seamlessly synchronize with your YouTube account to manage your subscriptions, playlists, and liked videos directly from your smartwatch.\n- Search Videos: Easily search for your favorite videos or discover new content with simple search tools.\n- Browsing trending videos, top videos, and video statistics.\n- Show videos from subscribed channels, history, watch later, liked videos and saved playlists\n- Multiple Quality Options: Enjoy videos with various quality settings, from Standard to UHD, for the best viewing experience.\n- Audio-Only mode\n\nWristTube brings ultimate convenience, allowing you to enjoy YouTube content anytime, anywhere, directly from your smartwatch. Download now and start exploring your favorite videos effortlessly!\n\nDetailed subscription information: \n- 3-day free trial, then weekly subscription ($1.99/week)\n- Monthly subscription ($2.99/month)\n- One-time lifetime purchase package ($7.99)\n\nPayment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal. Subscription may be cancelled at any time within the iTunes and App Store Apple ID Settings. All prices include applicable local sales taxes. Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.\n\n- Support: https://wristtechstudio.com/contact\n- Privacy Policy: https://wristtechstudio.com/privacy\n- Terms & Conditions: https://wristtechstudio.com/terms\n\nFor any question and inquires, please get in touch: contact@wristtechstudio.com",
      "releaseNotes": "- Service updates\n- Fixed an issue where searches and watched videos were not being saved to history\n- Improved video loading performance\n- Fixed some minor bugs",
